            "chapter_label": "Comeback",
            "eyebrow": "EvlveX · The first collection",
            "heading": "COMEBACK",
            "heading_size": "display",
            "text": "Falling behind is not the end. Sometimes, it is where the comeback begins.\nCOMEBACK is about what happens after life knocks you down: the strength to keep going, the courage to move forward, and the choice to become someone new.\nOne story in two chapters: The Silent Grind, for the battles no one sees, and A Fresh Start, for the first step into what comes next.",
