            "focus_x": 50,
            "focus_y": 50,
            "chapter_label": "A Fresh Start",
            "eyebrow": "Chapter 02",
            "heading": "A Fresh Start",
            "heading_size": "title",
            "text": "The moment after the struggle, when you stop looking back and choose what comes next.\nA Fresh Start is about carrying the lessons forward, leaving the weight behind, and taking the first step into a new chapter.\nCream and sand, with the monogram embossed in sand. For the first step into what comes next.",
