        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Every comeback starts the same way: on the ground.</p><p>A missed chance. A closed door. A season that took more than it gave.</p><p>Nobody claps for the early mornings. Nobody sees the second attempt, or the tenth.</p><p>That is the silent grind. It is where the real work happens.</p><p>Then one day you stop looking back. You lace up. You take the first step.</p><p>That is a fresh start. It is where the story turns.</p><p>EvlveX is made for the road between the two: for everyone who fell behind and refused to stay there.</p><p><strong>Never give up on your comeback.</strong></p>"
          }
        },
